    "native_firmware": "python3 qemu-extensions/prototypes/pulse/run-native-fixture.py --execution firmware --feature all --mode connected --qemu /explicit/qemu-system-xtensa --flash /explicit/pulse-native.merged.bin --sdkconfig /explicit/sdkconfig --evidence /explicit/evidence",
    "native_qtest": "python3 qemu-extensions/prototypes/pulse/run-native-fixture.py --execution qtest --feature ledc-pcnt --mode connected --qemu /explicit/qemu-system-xtensa --flash /explicit/pulse-native.merged.bin --evidence /explicit/evidence",
    "other_runs": "Repeat connected/disconnected/wrong-wire for firmware and qtest; both support all, ledc-pcnt, mcpwm and sdm. MCPWM qtest records actual complementary/deadtime/capture-net pulses, shadow compare, GPIO sync/fault, gates/stop/reset; the controller-owner suite additionally covers both groups, carrier and detailed register masks. --build uses the pinned checkout and creates evidence-local sdkconfig/build/flash. --adc-provider-ready requires an existing evidence JSON with status READY; no converter readiness is inferred from electrical.support.adc.",
    "platform": "Runner QMP/qtest Unix sockets require WSL/Linux. Source flash is always copied to a writable evidence-local raw disk before QEMU starts. No official/frozen tree is modified."
  },
  "qualification": {
    "firmware": "Actual public IDF driver handles, physical GPIO matrix PCNT/capture/sync/fault inputs, bounded ISR records. Guest ISR timestamps are not electrical edge timestamps.",
    "qtest": "Real MMIO, explicit v3 graph, clock_step next-deadline observations of resolved physical levels; records each change and exact observation virtual ns, never replaces pulses with averaged GPIO voltage. Multiple opposite transitions inside the same integer-ns settled deadline cannot be separated by this observer.",
    "sdm": "Actual waveform-profile/waveform-assumptions QOM properties must declare s3-sdm-second-order-transfer-v1. Documented density functional profile only; exact second-order hidden-width/reset/startup silicon sequence is explicitly unavailable. API disable alone does not stop hardware on this IDF target.",
    "rc": "Explicit finite-driver 1 kohm/1 uF passive RC, sampled waveform mean/ripple over last half-window. Not physical metrology. ADC conversion attempted only with externally declared READY provider."
  },
